<title>UK: Lucasvarity buys back shares at 192p each.</title>
<headline>Lucasvarity buys back shares at 192p each.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British automotive and aerospace engineering group LucasVarity Plc said on Thursday it had bought 1.0 million of its ordinary shares from Hoare Govett Securities Ltd at 192p per share.</p>
<p>The company said it had bought the shares for cancellation. The shares represent around 0.07 percent of LucasVarity's issued ordinary share capital.</p>
<p>LucasVarity shares last traded at 191p, down 1-1/2p, in London.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
